#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "That GPU node or GPU does not exist, or is on a device you do not have access to."
msgstr "ያ የGPU ኖድ ወይም GPU የለም፣ ወይም እርስዎ መዳረሻ በሌለዎት መሳሪያ ላይ ነው።"

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU data query could not be added to the device. Check that the plugin's templates are installed."
msgstr "የGPU የውሂብ መጠይቁ ወደ መሳሪያው መታከል አልቻለም። የተሰኪው አብነቶች መጫናቸውን ያረጋግጡ።"

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Device: the node's device was deleted, so the node can only be disabled."
msgstr "መሳሪያ፦ የኖዱ መሳሪያ ተሰርዟል፣ ስለዚህ ኖዱ መሰናከል ብቻ ነው የሚችለው።"

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Device: choose an existing Cacti device."
msgstr "መሳሪያ፦ ነባር የCacti መሳሪያ ይምረጡ።"

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Device: this device is already a GPU node."
msgstr "መሳሪያ፦ ይህ መሳሪያ ቀድሞውኑ የGPU ኖድ ነው።"

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU node was saved."
msgstr "የGPU ኖዱ ተቀምጧል።"

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU node could not be saved."
msgstr "የGPU ኖዱ ሊቀመጥ አልቻለም።"

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU node was removed. Its Cacti device was left in place."
msgstr "የGPU ኖዱ ተወግዷል። የCacti መሳሪያው ባለበት ተትቷል።"

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU node was not removed because GPU records belong to it. Disable it instead; GPU records are never deleted."
msgstr "የGPU መዝገቦች ስላሉት የGPU ኖዱ አልተወገደም። በምትኩ ያሰናክሉት፤ የGPU መዝገቦች በፍጹም አይሰረዙም።"

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU now belongs to the node it was seen at, with its history."
msgstr "GPUው አሁን ከታሪኩ ጋር በታየበት ኖድ ስር ሆኗል።"

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU stays with its recorded node."
msgstr "GPUው ከተመዘገበበት ኖድ ጋር ይቆያል።"

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU will leave the data query at the next reindex. Its graphs and RRD files are kept."
msgstr "GPUው በሚቀጥለው ዳግም መረጃ ጠቋሚ ጊዜ የውሂብ መጠይቁን ይለቃል። ግራፎቹ እና RRD ፋይሎቹ ይቀመጣሉ።"

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Only an absent GPU can be removed from the data query."
msgstr "ከውሂብ መጠይቁ ሊወገድ የሚችለው የሌለ GPU ብቻ ነው።"

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Creating a device needs permission to manage Cacti devices."
msgstr "መሳሪያ ለመፍጠር የCacti መሳሪያዎችን የማስተዳደር ፈቃድ ያስፈልጋል።"

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Description: enter up to 150 printable characters."
msgstr "መግለጫ፦ እስከ 150 የሚደርሱ ሊታተሙ የሚችሉ ቁምፊዎችን ያስገቡ።"

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Hostname: enter a host name or IP address."
msgstr "የአስተናጋጅ ስም፦ የአስተናጋጅ ስም ወይም የIP አድራሻ ያስገቡ።"

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU Node device template is not installed."
msgstr "የGPU ኖድ መሳሪያ አብነት አልተጫነም።"

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The device was not kept: your account may not see devices it creates. Ask an administrator to create it."
msgstr "መሳሪያው አልተቀመጠም፦ መለያዎ የፈጠራቸውን መሳሪያዎች ላይመለከት ይችላል። አስተዳዳሪ እንዲፈጥረው ይጠይቁ።"

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The device could not be removed after access was refused. Ask an administrator to remove it."
msgstr "መዳረሻ ከተከለከለ በኋላ መሳሪያው ሊወገድ አልቻለም። አስተዳዳሪ እንዲያስወግደው ይጠይቁ።"

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The device and its GPU node were created. Set the device's SNMP settings on its device page."
msgstr "መሳሪያው እና የGPU ኖዱ ተፈጥረዋል። የመሳሪያውን የSNMP ቅንብሮች በመሳሪያው ገጽ ላይ ያዋቅሩ።"

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The device could not be created; see the Cacti log."
msgstr "መሳሪያው ሊፈጠር አልቻለም፤ የCacti መዝገብን ይመልከቱ።"

#: gpu_operator.php
msgid "Monitoring view"
msgstr "የክትትል እይታ"

#: gpu_operator.php
msgid "Observations could not be read. Ask an administrator to check the plugin log."
msgstr "ምልከታዎቹን ማንበብ አልተቻለም። አስተዳዳሪ የተሰኪውን መዝገብ እንዲያረጋግጥ ይጠይቁ።"

